 "source": "return function(condition, primary, fallback)\n\tlocal selected\n\n\tif condition then\n\t\tselected = primary\n\telse\n\t\tselected = fallback\n\tend\n\n\tif selected == nil then\n\t\treturn selected, \"missing\"\n\telse\n\t\treturn selected, \"present\"\n\tend\nend\n"
